WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.191
It was a few days later.

2
00:00:07.192 --> 00:00:14.853
Soldier stood at his post near the window.

3
00:00:14.854 --> 00:00:19.167
"Alert! Alert! Vicky is here!"

4
00:00:19.168 --> 00:00:28.002
"Oh no!" Several toys gasped and hid.

5
00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:32.286
Rabbit sat on a shelf. "Who's Vicky?"

6
00:00:32.287 --> 00:00:35.268
"Henry's cousin," Horse said.

7
00:00:35.269 --> 00:00:37.777
He looked worried.

8
00:00:37.778 --> 00:00:42.060
"Just wait, Rabbit!" Robot grinned.

9
00:00:42.061 --> 00:00:46.036
"She's going to rip you to pieces!"

10
00:00:46.037 --> 00:00:54.181
Rabbit heard footsteps.

11
00:00:54.182 --> 00:01:00.342
Then a girl with pigtails came in.

12
00:01:00.343 --> 00:01:05.289
She was holding a red drone.

13
00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.756
"She doesn't look so bad," Rabbit thought.

14
00:01:09.757 --> 00:01:13.691
Vicky suddenly stopped in front of Rabbit.

15
00:01:13.692 --> 00:01:17.062
"Perfect!" she cried.

16
00:01:17.063 --> 00:01:19.327
Vicky grabbed Rabbit tightly.

17
00:01:19.328 --> 00:01:22.866
"Ouch!" he thought.

18
00:01:22.867 --> 00:01:30.607
Vicky plopped the drone on the floor.

19
00:01:30.608 --> 00:01:35.580
She tied Rabbit to the top of it with string.

20
00:01:35.581 --> 00:01:38.934
The motor whirred underneath Rabbit.

21
00:01:38.935 --> 00:01:41.752
"What's happening?" Rabbit thought.

22
00:01:41.753 --> 00:01:44.291
"I don't want to get hurt!"

23
00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:45.521
Whoosh!

24
00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:51.028
The drone shot up into the air.

25
00:01:51.029 --> 00:01:52.044
Boom!

26
00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:57.814
It smashed into the ceiling.

27
00:01:57.815 --> 00:02:02.126
Rabbit fell off and went tumbling down.

28
00:02:02.127 --> 00:02:05.614
Rip! His right shoulder tore open.

29
00:02:05.614 --> 00:02:08.408
Stuffing spilled out.

30
00:02:08.409 --> 00:02:13.752
"Ugh," Rabbit thought. "I hurt all over."

31
00:02:13.753 --> 00:02:16.795
Henry ran into the room.

32
00:02:16.796 --> 00:02:19.294
"Vicky!" he shouted.

33
00:02:19.295 --> 00:02:22.957
"What did you do to Rabbit?"

34
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:27.855
Robot gave a mean laugh.

35
00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:31.046
"I told you, Rabbit!" he whispered.

36
00:02:31.047 --> 00:02:37.577
"It's over for you!"

